    "body": "## Chat05A merged into main - confirmed GitHub checkpoint (2026-10-31 JST)\n\n**Owner explicitly instructed merge.** Standard GitHub `merge` of PR #460 succeeded with expected head lease, no force-push/squash/rebase.\n\n- PR: `CLOSED/MERGED`, `https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/pull/460`.\n- Merged source HEAD: `99d4322dc1a9fba76f113f32db93829bf4c64407`.\n- Old main: `b435e70eb88b87b3c3324ef2a2da14cdf473f229`.\n- **New main merge commit**: `00ce2baca8dca177dfadffcb8bccbae11bca118f`. Parent SHAs verified in GitHub (old main + PR head).\n- Pre-merge exact-HEAD GitHub check-runs: **8/8 SUCCESS**. PR description reported independent `PASS_CRITICAL_REVIEW` on exact HEAD. No formal GitHub review submission was present; do not misrepresent this as formal GitHub approval.\n- No hosted gameplay Worker deploy, Cloudflare/D1 remote migration, secret mutation, manual Pages trigger, invites, or Safari acceptance was performed.\n- GitHub Pages has **automatically** run due to `main:/docs` changes, not by a manual deployment request. Pages workflow `41140207139` and legacy Pages recovery `41140208394` completed **SUCCESS**. This is a real Pages publication side effect and must be disclosed.\n- Post-merge `main` workflows: `Chat03B1 CAS SQL #41140208437 SUCCESS`; `ai-forensics #41140208519 SUCCESS`; `Chat03B2 gameplay API #41140208550` was **in_progress** at the last live check, so post-merge all-checks PASS is not yet declared. Verify exact-main completed job conclusion before subsequent work.\n- Canonical Notion at last direct fetch: `MEMORY_REV=2026-10-31-PROраб-NOTION-01-045-CONFIRMED-R236`, `PLAN_REV=2026-10-31-PROраб-DEPENDENCY-UNLOCK-NOTICES-V16`. Notion central memory/plan were not modified by this merge lane; synchronize in authorized serialized lane rather than overwriting another coordinator.\n\n**Routing/gates:** Chat05A is source-merged and its open-PR write scope on `gameplay-server/src/worker.js` is released. Chat05B may review updated main and, after validating post-merge Worker/D1 CI, server clock/transactions and live ownership, start its own controlled implementation lane; not an automatic Chat05B PASS. Chat03 may resume staging preparation after fresh shared-file ownership checks, but separate identity/security custody, remote migration, backup/restore and deploy approval gates remain. Chat06 runtime and Chat05C await Chat05B PASS. Overall Chat05 runtime/Safari PASS is NOT claimed.",
